                                "sense_id": "08ef3f26-8880-32ae-94ea-4e10d29cd30c",
                                "text": "One morning she had me traipsing out at the crack of dawn for prickly poppy, toadflax, spiderwort, and skeleton weed. If that doesn't sound like the makings of a witch's brew, then I'm the queen of England."
                            }
                        ]
